OL,3,GNEWSAMan pleads guilty to racist
OL,4,ABadenoch death threats
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has pleaded guilty to sending the
OL,7,FConservative leader Kemi Badenoch
OL,8,Femails threatening to shoot her dead.
OL,10,FKieran Kyle sent three emails on 2 May
OL,11,Fto the Tory party leader in which he
OL,12,Fmade racist references and claimed to
OL,13,Fhave been in the IRA, a court has
OL,14,Fheard.
OL,16,FOn Tuesday, the 43-year-old pleaded
OL,17,Fguilty at Westminster Magistrates'
OL,18,FCourt to two counts of sending
OL,19,Fcommunications of an indecent or
OL,20,Foffensive nature.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
